    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Telling the time",
     "texto": [
      "**九点** is nine o'clock; **九点半**, half past nine. **一刻** means quarter of an hour and **三点一刻**, quarter past three. **分** and **分钟** relate to minutes; **小时** counts hours of duration."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
