     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The time of an activity",
     "texto": [
      "**几点** asks what time. **开始** means to start and **结束**, to end. **上课** means to have or start class; **下课**, to end it. Unlike English «have» and «has», the verb does not change with the person."
